/T (The piloting took place on 14 November 2025 as part of a full-day CERN initiative inviting teachers to bring their classes to discover activities in robotics, coding, and artificial intelligence. In total, four teachers and fifty students participated in four sessions of 1h30 each, welcoming four different classes spanning 8 to 16 years old. Two groups came from either French cross-boarder schools or international schools. Gender distribution across the participating groups was reported as well balanced.)
