408 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 186 0 R
/E (The Teacher Training Programme was organised in Heverlee \(Belgium\) and involved 30 participants, mainly primary school teachers, along with a small number of special education teachers, STEAM or ICT coordinators, representatives of community organisations, and students in a programming associate degree. The training was delivered through two intensive full-day sessions \(7 and 12 November 2025\) followed by two online follow-up sessions \(10 and 12 December 2025\), covering eight modules. Prior to the training, participants were introduced to the Moodle platform and completed a survey on their background and experience with robotics. The results showed that although participants were experienced educators, many had limited prior experience with educational robotics, highlighting the need for targeted professional development. The training combined theoretical input with hands-on exploration of a wide range of tools, including Makey Makey, Tale-Bot, Indi Sphero, Edison, Photon, Micro:bit, Scratch extensions, and Cubetto. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
