461 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 2618 0 R
/E (A Progressive Approach to Teaching Computational Thinking: From Unplugged to Digital)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
462 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 189 0 R
/E (This approach removed the initial barrier of technical anxiety that generalist teachers experience with coding or robotics. The unplugged phase built intuitive understanding and confidence before digital formalisations. Teachers could relate abstract concepts to concrete, embodied experiences, making the transition to digital tools feel natural. Unplugged activities also made interdisciplinary links with humanities more visible, as they inherently involve storytelling, collaboration, and creative expression.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 189 0 R
/E <>
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
464 0 obj
