/P 190 0 R
/E (Description of the Practice)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
491 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 190 0 R
/E (Teachers described the AI integration as a shift in their creative process: from blank-page anxiety to rapid prototyping. The group spontaneously used AI-generated content as a base for the lesson plans they designed. The approach made differentiation feel accessible and creative rather than technical.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
