/P 200 0 R
/E (This approach helps educators understand how robotics can support accessibility, collaboration, and differentiated learning. By embedding inclusion in the lesson design process, teachers developed a more holistic understanding of how robotics activities can engage all students and create equitable learning opportunities.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [9]
>>
