/P 200 0 R
/E (Teachers reported increased confidence in designing robotics activities that are accessible to diverse learners. The lesson plans produced during the training reflected thoughtful differentiation strategies and creative uses of Bee-Bot and Tale-Bot across different learning needs. Participants demonstrated a stronger awareness of how robotics can support inclusive and collaborative classroom environments.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [11]
>>
