1152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 216 0 R
/E (Many successful robotics activities are based on collaboration, experimentation, and problem-solving. Group work, challenge-based tasks, and collaborative debugging encourage students to share ideas, learn from mistakes, and develop resilience in the learning process.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [3]
>>
