1154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 216 0 R
/E (Robotics education should allow students to explore, test ideas, and develop creative solutions rather than simply following predefined instructions. Open-ended challenges and project-based learning activities help students develop deeper understanding and ownership of their learning.)
/Pg 48 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
